{"id":"c35eaa9794525bdd","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-space-bounded-prg.md","title":"欺骗有限宽度分支程序的生成器","display":"df-space-bounded-prg — 欺骗有限宽度分支程序的生成器","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-space-bounded-prg","aliases":["28-df-space-bounded-prg"],"display":"df-space-bounded-prg — 欺骗有限宽度分支程序的生成器","depends_on":["[[28-df-branching-program]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.6; equation (21.14)","source_printed_pages":"449","source_pdf_pages":"475","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-space-bounded-prg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-space-bounded-prg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-space-bounded-prg — 欺骗有限宽度分支程序的生成器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e2886eda40b8b0a\" href=\"?note=5e2886eda40b8b0a\" title=\"28-df-branching-program\">28-df-branching-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.6; equation (21.14)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"449"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"475"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,T,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(w,T,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\epsilon\\in[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\{0,1\\}^s\\to\\{0,1\\}^T\">\\(G:\\{0,1\\}^s\\to\\{0,1\\}^T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\">\\(\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(r)\">\\(B(r)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e2886eda40b8b0a\" href=\"?note=5e2886eda40b8b0a\" title=\"28-df-branching-program\">28-df-branching-program</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 表示 j 个独立公平比特。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpacePRG}(G;w,T,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\\quad\\left|\\Pr[B(G(U_s))=1]-\\Pr[B(U_T)=1]\\right|\\le\\epsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SpacePRG}(G;w,T,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\\quad\\left|\\Pr[B(G(U_s))=1]-\\Pr[B(U_T)=1]\\right|\\le\\epsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书空间受限机器生成器保证的配置图接口。空间 O(log w) 的状态机在 T 步内只向前读取随机位，可展开为该分支程序。定义只陈述欺骗保证；生成器的统一计算复杂度在 Nisan 定理中单独约束。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§21.6; equation (21.14)；印刷页 449；PDF 页 475。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-branching-program","status":"resolved","id":"5e2886eda40b8b0a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-branching-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-branching-program","status":"resolved","id":"5e2886eda40b8b0a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$w,T,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\epsilon\\in[0,1]$，$G:\\{0,1\\}^s\\to\\{0,1\\}^T$。$\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}$ 与 $B(r)$ 见 [[28-df-branching-program]]；$U_j$ 表示 j 个独立公平比特。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"w,T,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\{0,1\\}^s\\to\\{0,1\\}^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}","display":false},{"tex":"B(r)","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpacePRG}(G;w,T,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\\quad\\left|\\Pr[B(G(U_s))=1]-\\Pr[B(U_T)=1]\\right|\\le\\epsilon.","display":true}],"bytes":1405,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"},{"id":"514ffe6f762a37f2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{SpacePRG}$ 采用 [[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，其中函数的输入与输出均为单个二进制字串。$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；$\\ell_n=\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil$（$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$）。"}],"outgoing":["5e2886eda40b8b0a"]}